cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Combolite (db-combolite) in your research or software, please cite it as below."
title: "db-combolite: a crash-safe embeddable multi-model C99 database engine"
abstract: >-
  db-combolite is the multi-package workspace for Combolite, a pure C99, crash-safe,
  embeddable multi-model database engine (document, table, vector, time-series, and
  graph-link models with full-text search and the CMBQL query language), built around a
  no-heap, caller-owned-buffer memory model for host and microcontroller profiles, with
  optional CUDA/Vulkan accelerators.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The Combolite contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/gorovehq/db-combolite"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - database
  - embedded
  - C99
  - multi-model
  - vector-database
  - time-series
